# ── Documentation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything *.md stays local-only (line 2): SPEC.md, constitution.md, dossiers —
# they name the VPS IP, deploy paths and the mail host, and this repo may be public.
# AGENTS.md is the single deliberate exception: it carries *behaviour* rules, no
# secrets. Re-check after editing: `git check-ignore -v AGENTS.md` must print nothing.
!AGENTS.md
!.github/copilot-instructions.md

